# JEFFLOCAL_TENANT_NAME/JEFFLOCAL_DB_PATH values) to the real business name
# only when that tenant is actually ready to go live — see
# governance/MULTI_TENANCY_PROPOSAL.md and governance/TENANT_REGISTRY.md.
